  "title": "Best BBQ Shrimp Ever",
  "description": "This simple marinade for shrimp is guaranteed to please. Passed down by my mother-in-law, it's without a doubt one of her greatest contributions to humankind.",
  "authors": [
    "Hugh Pastoriza"
  ],
